@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Training Flow — PPO Training Runner

participant "Script\ntrain.py" as Script
participant "TrainingRunner" as Runner
participant "Registry" as Registry
participant "GRUCardModel" as Model
participant "Filesystem" as FS

== 1. Initialization ==

Script -> Script: Parse CLI args\n(sample-path, output-path, model, epoch)
Script -> FS: Read config/backend.json
Script -> Script: Build TrainingConfig
Script -> Runner: run(config)

activate Runner

Runner -> Registry: get_ai_info(config.model)
Registry --> Runner: {module, class, weight_path}
Runner -> Model: Instantiate GRUCardModel\nLoad weights from weight_path
Runner -> Runner: Detect device\n(cuda if available, else cpu)
Runner -> Model: model.to(device)
Runner -> Runner: Convert INITIAL_HIDDEN_STATE\nto tensor (1,1,8) on device

== 2. Load Samples ==

Runner -> FS: Load sample file(s)\nfrom config.sample_path
FS --> Runner: List of games → extract perspectives
Runner -> Runner: Validate: at least 1 perspective found
Runner -> Runner: Build action-to-index map\n{attack:0, defense:1, heavy:2, counter:3}

== 3. Training Loop ==

loop epoch = 1..config.epoch

    Runner -> Runner: Shuffle all perspectives
    Runner -> Runner: Group into accumulation groups\n(batch_size = config.batch_size)

    loop each group
        Runner -> Runner: Initialize group metrics\n(total_loss=0, policy_loss=0,\nvalue_loss=0, entropy=0, grad_norm=0)
        Runner -> Model: optimizer.zero_grad()

        loop each perspective in group (one at a time)

            == 3a. Load data from sample ==

            Runner -> Runner: Read steps from sample JSON:\nstate_t, action, old_log_prob, old_value, reward

            Runner -> Runner: Replace null old_log_prob\nwith 0.0 (greedy sample steps)

            == 3b. Compute GAE advantages ==

            note right of Runner
                Compute GAE advantages:
                A_t = sum((gamma*lambda)^k * delta_{t+k})
                where delta_t = r_t + gamma*V_{t+1} - old_V_t
                V_{t+1}=0 for terminal step
                V_target_t = A_t + old_V_t
            end note

            == 3c. GRU forward pass ==

            Runner -> Runner: h = INITIAL_HIDDEN_STATE tensor
            loop each step in perspective
                Runner -> Model: forward(state_t, h,\nmask_fn=None, temperature=1.0)
                Model --> Runner: (probs, log_probs, value, new_h)
                Runner -> Runner: Record new_log_prob_t via\naction-to-index mapping
                Runner -> Runner: Record new_value_t
                Runner -> Runner: h = new_h
            end

            == 3d. Compute loss & accumulate gradients ==

            note right of Runner
                PPO clipped loss per perspective:
                ratio = exp(new_log - old_log)
                L_clip = -min(ratio*A, clip(ratio)*A)
                L_value = (V_target - V_new)^2
                L_entropy = -sum(p*log(p))
                L_total = (L_clip + cv*L_value - ce*L_entropy) / T
                (averaged over all T steps)
            end note

            Runner -> Model: (L_total / batch_size).backward()
            note right: accumulate gradients\navoids GRU padding

            Runner -> Runner: Accumulate perspective metrics\n(unscaled loss components)
        end

        == 3e. Update weights ==

        Runner -> Model: clip_grad_norm_(max_grad_norm)
        Runner -> Runner: Compute gradient norm
        Runner -> Model: optimizer.step()
        note right: single update after\nall perspectives accumulated

        Runner -> Runner: Accumulate group metrics\n(average of unscaled losses)
    end

    Runner -> Runner: Compute epoch averages
    Runner -> Script: Print: epoch N/M | avg_loss | policy_loss | value_loss | entropy | grad_norm
end

== 4. Save Outputs ==

Runner -> FS: torch.save(model.state_dict(), config.output_path)
Runner -> Runner: Generate loss/loss.png\nfrom epoch_losses
Runner -> FS: Write loss/loss.csv\n(epoch,avg_loss,policy_loss,value_loss,entropy)
Runner -> Runner: Generate loss/grad.png\nfrom epoch_grad_norms
Runner -> FS: Write loss/grad.csv\n(epoch,grad_norm)

deactivate Runner

Runner --> Script: Training complete

@enduml
